{"version":1,"content":"<p>日前，<strong>巴西一名男子遭遇驚險一幕，放在褲兜裏的iPhone突然冒煙起火，男子不得不當街脱掉短褲，以避免被燒傷。</strong>據媒體報道，事發時，該男子正在巴西裏約熱內盧西區駕車，遇到堵車時，他突然聞到車內有一股煙味。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588220.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T12:24:15.461859+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T12:09:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T12:17:22.626534+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T12:17:22.626534+00:00","content_hash":"df8105df831250a5501b8b18683c753eb299dbeb0d54e47e8b041ceeeb36f36d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}